      <definition>n. Wish, desire, inclination; appetite.</definition>
      <page>276</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠣᠷᠠᠰᠢᠯ ᠡᠭᠦᠰᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- egysgeky</transcript>
          <definition> To desire, have a mind to, be inclined to.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠣᠷᠠᠰᠢᠯ ᠨᠡᠭᠡᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- negegeky</transcript>
          <definition> To [show one's] desire.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠣᠷᠠᠰᠢᠯ ᠦᠯᠦ ᠠᠮᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- yly amuxu</transcript>
          <definition> For the desire not to cease.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠨᠠᠳᠤ ᠡᠭᠦᠨ ᠢ ᠠᠪᠬᠤ ᠳᠣᠷᠠᠰᠢᠯ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠨ᠎ᠠ ᠤᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>cimadu egyn i abxu -- bain-a uu</transcript>
          <definition> Do you want to buy this?.</definition>
